{
  "_comment": "WICA demo benchmark matrix (specs/benchmark.md, 'The matrix'). One entry per model under test; 'agent' is the config's agent block, merged over 'agent_defaults' (the demo's persona, so every row drives the same robot). Ids verified 2026-11-09 against each provider's models endpoint (Anthropic, Mistral, the Gemini API list, the Hub's inference_provider filter) or by a one-token chat probe (OpenAI; the key has no model-list scope) \u2014 see README.md, 'Model catalog'. Optional per-entry keys: tags (filter with --tags / --exclude-tags: 'default' = the demo's committed model for that provider; 'small' / 'mid' / 'large' = the provider's own tier words; 'reasoning' = thinks before answering; 'open' = open weights; 'api' = hosted; 'fixture' = no network, scripted), enabled (false = opt-in with --include-disabled), requires_env (extra env vars that gate the entry), notes. Reasoning models run at the provider's floor (Anthropic reasoning_effort low \u2014 thinking cannot be off on the 5.5 line; OpenAI minimal / none; Gemini thinking_level low) so the latency column compares like with like: a conversational robot wants the fastest answer a model gives.",
  "agent_defaults": {
    "system_prompt_file": "../examples/conversation_demo/prompts/wica.md"
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "fake",
      "agent": {
        "provider": "fake",
        "model": "scripted",
        "system_prompt": "You are a test robot.",
        "model_kwargs": {
          "delay_s": 0,
          "script": [
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "say",
                  "args": {
                    "text": "Hello! Nice to meet you."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "noop",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "say",
                  "args": {
                    "text": "I can chat with you, dance and show emotions."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "noop",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "say",
                  "args": {
                    "text": "Once upon a time a little robot named Bolt wanted to dance. Every night it practiced alone in the workshop. Its first steps were clumsy and it fell many times. Slowly the moves became smooth and joyful. One day it danced for everyone and they cheered."
                  },
                  "id": "story"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "cancel_command",
                  "args": {
                    "call_id": "story"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "say",
                  "args": {
                    "text": "Okay, I'll stop."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "noop",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "say",
                  "args": {
                    "text": "Hi Alex, nice to meet you."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "noop",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "say",
                  "args": {
                    "text": "Yes!"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "noop",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "say",
                  "args": {
                    "text": "Goodbye! See you soon."
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tool_calls": [
                {
                  "name": "noop",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "default": {
            "tool_calls": [
              {
                "name": "noop",
                "args": {}
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "enabled": false,
      "tags": [
        "fixture"
      ],
      "notes": "The key-less path: a scripted fake that plays the whole `conversation` session (one scripted model call per step, the long story cancelled by id), so `conversation` passes and `commands` does not. Harness floor; opt in with --only fake --include-disabled."
    },
